&lt;p>Package crc64 implements the 64-bit cyclic redundancy check, or CRC-64, checksum. See &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyclic_redundancy_check">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyclic_redundancy_check&lt;/a> for information.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>​	crc64 包实现了 64 位循环冗余校验或 CRC-64 校验和。有关信息，请参阅 &lt;a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyclic_redundancy_check">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyclic_redundancy_check&lt;/a>。&lt;/p>
